    "Id": "chassisdef_menace_MNC-G",
    "Name": "Menace",
    "Details": "The experimental G configuration of the Menace combines two Improved Railguns with two Rotary Gauss Rifles. As there is little space left, no other weapons nor the otherwise common Nova CEWS is available.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.42</color></b>",
